    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "New to the market with Richard Mulhall of RE/MAX Partners, 18 The Court, is a charming \r\nthree-bedroom mid-terrace home nestled within a quiet Cul de sac. No.18 comes to the market in great condition throughout and benefits with brand new gas central heating system. Located in highly sought of location of  Moyglare Hall and only a 10 minute stroll to Maynooth town centre, this wonderful property is a must view. \r\n\r\n\r\nThe accommodation briefly comprises of hallway, sitting room, kitchen / dinning room, guest w/c completes the downstairs. Upstairs are three double bedrooms with primary ensuite and  a\r\ngood-sized  main bathroom completes upstairs. \r\n\r\nExternally, the property features a cobble lock driveway providing off-street parking for two/ three cars. To the rear, you have a private north facing rear garden \r\n\r\n\r\nSituated in a quiet, sought-after neighbourhood, close to the town centre and within walking \r\ndistance of a number of schools, leisure and social amenities, this is a must-see property. Maynooth is a thriving town with many restaurants, bars, cafes, shops and leisure facilities. Ideally located, this property is several minutes drive from the M4, and close to public transport including bus and train services."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "ACCOMMODATION\r\n\r\nHALLWAY: c.3.77 x 1.86m\r\nCoving, centre rose, light fitting, wooden floor.\r\n\r\nLOUNGE: c.4.95 x 3.61m\r\nCoving, centre rose, light fitting, gas feature fireplace, blinds, wooden floor, TV/cable point.\r\n\r\nKITCHEN/DINING ROOM: c.4.66 x 5.58m\r\nLight fitting, fitted units, tiled splash back area, stainless steel sink, area plumbed, French double doors leading to patio/garden area, vertical blinds, tiled floor, phone point.\r\n\r\nGUEST WC: c.1.70 x 1.42m\r\nLight fitting, extractor fan, WC, WHB, tiled floor.\r\n\r\nLANDING: c.1.36 x 2.34m\r\nLight fitting, hot press, attic access, carpet.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 1: c.3.45 x 4.29m\r\nLight fitting, fitted wardrobes, blind, carpet, TV/cable point.\r\n\r\nENSUITE: c.2.26 x 1.00m\r\nLight fitting, wall & floor tiling, WC, WHB, cubicle with mains shower.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 2: c.3.59 x 2.94m\r\nLight fitting, fitted wardrobes, blind carpet\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 3: c.3.59 x 2.60m\r\nLight fitting, fitted wardrobes, blind, carpet.\r\n\r\nBATHROOM: c.1.94 x 1.93m\r\nLight fitting, extractor fan, light tunnel, fully tiled, WC,WHB, mains shower over bath."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "INTERNAL FEATURES\r\nAll curtains and carpets included in sale\r\nAll blinds included in sale\r\nAll light fittings included in sale\r\nWired for alarm\r\nSome appliances included in sale\r\n\r\nEXTERNAL FEATURES\r\nWooden double glazed windows\r\nPVC facia and soffits\r\nOutside light\r\nPatio area\r\nLocated in quiet cul de sac\r\nProperty not overlooked to front/rear\r\nCobble lock driveway\r\nOnsite parking\r\n\r\nSERVICES/HEATING:\t\r\nMains water \r\nMains sewerage\r\nCondensing boiler\r\nG.F.C.H\r\n\r\nFLOOR AREA: c.100.80 sq. mtrs.\r\n\r\nPROPERTY AGE: 2005\r\n\r\nBER RATING: B\r\n\r\nBER NUMBER: 101971943\r\n\r\nGARDEN ORIENTATION: \r\nNorth\r\n\r\nDISCLAIMER: All descriptions, dimensions, references to condition and necessary permission for use and occupation, and other details are given in good faith and are believed to be correct but any intending purchaser or tenant should not rely on them as statements or representations of fact but must satisfy himself/herself by inspection or    otherwise as to the correctness of each of them."
